00:40:25.500 --> 00:40:26.860
Young lady, let's dance this dance.

00:40:27.180 --> 00:40:28.620
With what foot? If you haven't broken it before.

00:40:28.900 --> 00:40:29.400
Less wax.

00:40:30.060 --> 00:40:31.760
I don't know how to dance, but I'm hanging out with my father.

00:40:31.980 --> 00:40:33.160
Then hang out with your father and leave me alone.

00:40:33.640 --> 00:40:35.000
What the hell are you saying to my face?

00:40:35.420 --> 00:40:37.100
Look, you're back.

00:40:37.600 --> 00:40:38.940
You with the masks, I thought you weren't coming.

00:40:39.160 --> 00:40:39.400
Here.

00:40:39.770 --> 00:40:40.190
What's this?

00:40:40.610 --> 00:40:41.620
Hey, you see?

00:40:41.980 --> 00:40:43.280
Well, go inside and see where you're going,

00:40:43.360 --> 00:40:44.380
because tonight you're going to be run over.

00:40:44.520 --> 00:40:45.260
I'm not going to die.

00:40:45.620 --> 00:40:46.240
Leave me alone.

00:40:47.000 --> 00:40:48.320
Look at that.

00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:54.040
What a woman.

00:40:56.120 --> 00:40:57.600
Oh, what a bad luck I have.

00:40:57.960 --> 00:40:58.960
Oh, I'm going. Help me.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:31.800
I searched everywhere without finding you.

00:41:32.020 --> 00:41:33.250
How long have I been here?

00:41:33.490 --> 00:41:35.270
In 15 days we leave for Peru.

00:41:35.490 --> 00:41:36.400
Will you come with me?

00:41:37.880 --> 00:41:38.160
Who knows?

00:41:39.610 --> 00:41:41.310
All this will be after our wedding.

00:41:41.590 --> 00:41:42.810
Are you going to get married?

00:41:42.950 --> 00:41:43.930
So you have the godfather.

00:41:44.150 --> 00:41:46.730
I promised you before I left and now I do.

00:41:47.050 --> 00:41:47.450
Congratulations.

00:42:30.120 --> 00:42:31.200
When will we see each other, Solea?

00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:33.660
If you always see me, don't you say you take me in your heart?

00:42:37.250 --> 00:42:39.170
Hey, what's up?

00:42:39.310 --> 00:42:39.980
Hello, Antonio.

00:42:40.280 --> 00:42:40.940
You guys here?

00:42:41.280 --> 00:42:42.270
What a surprise.

00:42:42.570 --> 00:42:43.310
Do you want a drink?

00:42:43.910 --> 00:42:44.270
Always.

00:42:44.550 --> 00:42:47.300
Are you having fun, my friend?

00:42:47.610 --> 00:42:49.150
You have been destroyed by the night dancing.

00:42:49.450 --> 00:42:50.430
Well, get up to the stage.

00:42:50.610 --> 00:42:51.630
And rest a little.

00:42:52.230 --> 00:42:52.770
Thank you.

00:42:53.130 --> 00:42:53.430
Thanks.

00:42:55.200 --> 00:42:56.400
Leave me alone.

00:42:56.700 --> 00:42:57.480
Am I annoying you?

00:42:57.580 --> 00:42:58.120
Not at all.

00:42:58.260 --> 00:42:58.800
For me, he's already dead.

00:43:03.230 --> 00:43:25.640
I'm going to introduce you to Corrito Boa, your wife, my wife that you don't know, and a friend of my wife, nice to meet you, thank you for serving us, let's go, to the family of all, and because each one of you gets this night whatever you want, let's go.

00:43:34.190 --> 00:43:34.930
No, it's not funny.

00:43:35.580 --> 00:43:36.500
You're leaving us alone?

00:43:36.720 --> 00:43:38.600
Very funny.

00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:41.840
You're beautiful with that costume.

00:43:42.020 --> 00:43:45.090
Do you enjoy dancing so much?

00:43:45.090 --> 00:43:45.870
A lot.

00:43:46.010 --> 00:43:47.410
You don't dance?

00:43:48.190 --> 00:43:48.470
No.

00:43:48.590 --> 00:43:51.220
Well, I swear I've seen you with Manolo Lucero.

00:43:51.320 --> 00:43:54.140
His partner wore a costume like yours.

00:43:54.740 --> 00:43:55.480
There are so many similarities.

00:43:56.340 --> 00:43:58.960
What's not in the world is someone who has two feet like yours.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:02.440
That you are above all Almento's flowers.

00:44:02.620 --> 00:44:04.710
At least they look like Almento to me.

00:44:06.110 --> 00:44:07.110
Oh, what a great thing.

00:44:07.490 --> 00:44:07.730
Why?

00:44:08.480 --> 00:44:09.960
What I have learned in 24.

00:44:10.380 --> 00:44:13.130
I have learned that living without you I have not lived.

00:44:13.970 --> 00:44:15.030
But with me neither.

00:44:15.700 --> 00:44:17.320
Miss, what you are talking about is my illusion.

00:44:17.880 --> 00:44:21.220
If it is not more than that, go with Dio because they are not here.

00:44:21.440 --> 00:44:24.380
I have said, my words of the dove.

00:44:25.670 --> 00:44:27.290
You return them to me and I will guard them.

00:44:27.310 --> 00:44:29.180
I tell you in remorse.

00:44:30.510 --> 00:44:31.470
Because you knew that condition.

00:44:31.810 --> 00:44:33.520
It's yours, I learned it from you.

00:44:35.260 --> 00:44:37.780
It's true, it's true.

00:44:38.020 --> 00:44:41.360
Since you left my sight,

00:44:41.460 --> 00:44:45.240
the birds sing and the flowers smell.

00:44:49.890 --> 00:44:51.290
You're taking advantage of the carnival.

00:44:51.370 --> 00:44:52.940
Are you dressed as Frontera?

00:44:53.330 --> 00:44:54.770
I'm letting my heart speak.

00:44:55.280 --> 00:44:55.420
What?

00:44:56.760 --> 00:44:59.540
Since he's seen you grow up like a sketch of the Rosal de Jerico.

00:45:00.480 --> 00:45:04.400
The one who found you at the orchard of a trip made to a serrana that gave envy to the moon.

00:45:04.560 --> 00:45:07.000
You know.

00:45:07.280 --> 00:45:12.040
What made you believe that you were the owner of the world?

00:45:12.240 --> 00:45:13.820
I already had what man's vanity can do.

00:45:14.020 --> 00:45:18.040
I forgot that you were for me the beginning and the end of all things.

00:45:18.340 --> 00:45:20.450
Will you forgive me?

00:45:32.880 --> 00:45:33.800
Are you okay, Molea?

00:45:34.560 --> 00:45:38.350
You are in the world. Don't give me airs that I can't live without you.

00:45:38.470 --> 00:45:42.140
Go home. I'm begging you, kneel down if you want.

00:45:43.890 --> 00:45:46.750
Okay, take it.

00:45:46.890 --> 00:45:48.690
For you, thank you.

00:45:50.630 --> 00:45:51.330
Burn your hands.

00:45:51.530 --> 00:45:57.480
You can't leave me alone.

00:45:57.900 --> 00:45:59.120
Don't kill me, poor girl.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:01.970
It's a bad night, and you're sleepy.

00:46:02.230 --> 00:46:03.810
God, men with lips!

00:46:04.250 --> 00:46:23.920
You want each other like two

00:46:23.920 --> 00:46:26.790
Thank God, I was and I came and they didn't give me anything.

00:46:28.840 --> 00:46:29.740
Comrades of the old...

00:48:33.360 --> 00:48:34.280
Tocenillo, what time is it?

00:48:34.420 --> 00:48:35.590
It's four o'clock.

00:48:35.750 --> 00:48:35.990
Already?

00:48:45.210 --> 00:48:48.660
The party is advanced, five minutes are left.

00:48:48.720 --> 00:48:49.700
What time is my example?

00:48:50.520 --> 00:48:51.720
I don't know, it must be in the square.

00:48:52.380 --> 00:48:53.040
Letting me stand?

00:48:54.320 --> 00:48:55.440
I say, I don't know.

00:48:55.620 --> 00:48:57.300
Sometimes men have commitments.

00:48:57.720 --> 00:48:59.560
I say, you don't listen to me.

00:49:00.220 --> 00:49:01.260
Neither to you, nor to the boss.

00:49:01.500 --> 00:49:04.140
He's already given me a lot of orders to put up with one more.

00:49:04.300 --> 00:49:04.810
Go for a walk.

00:49:05.030 --> 00:49:05.390
All the time!

00:49:05.730 --> 00:49:07.380
Follow him!

00:49:07.660 --> 00:49:26.060
The race must have ended already.

00:49:26.280 --> 00:49:28.760
I say, half an hour ago I left the square.

00:49:29.040 --> 00:49:29.980
You too, you moron.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:30.620
What?

00:49:36.650 --> 00:49:39.470
How sad this is.

00:49:39.650 --> 00:49:41.040
It won't take long to come to the meeting.

00:49:41.340 --> 00:49:42.240
Wait in the restaurant.

00:49:42.520 --> 00:49:47.400
Since when the people who eat my bread go to the bulls without service for me?

00:49:47.700 --> 00:49:50.020
What is that of leaving the house alone as if they were evicted?

00:49:50.120 --> 00:49:52.140
Did you think that I should make an excuse?

00:49:52.400 --> 00:49:55.710
Because as I am a tyrant, I need to go learning.

00:49:56.050 --> 00:49:56.670
It is that I ...

00:49:56.670 --> 00:49:59.850
You and who you are not, you have figured that I leave ...

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:01.600
...to beat up women, isn't that so?

00:50:01.880 --> 00:50:04.660
Well, look, the truth is that I've had enough with all of you...

00:50:04.660 --> 00:50:06.420
...and I'll put my face on your back, understood?

00:50:06.900 --> 00:50:09.220
Understood. Do you want me to sign it?

00:50:09.400 --> 00:50:10.080
I want more money.

00:50:11.100 --> 00:50:14.020
Without a voice, kid, without a voice.

00:50:14.160 --> 00:50:15.920
I give it to you because I'm willing to keep it.

00:50:16.180 --> 00:50:20.160
If you meet a handsome man who doubts you, tell him.

00:50:20.580 --> 00:50:23.700
I think that accompanying a friend's girlfriend who is alone in the bulls...

00:50:23.820 --> 00:50:25.120
...shouldn't have any fear of life.

00:50:25.300 --> 00:50:25.840
Yes, man, yes.

00:50:26.020 --> 00:50:29.430
You should have left me there alone so that people would have fun messing with me.

00:50:30.090 --> 00:50:30.350
I'll do it again.

00:50:31.370 --> 00:50:36.010
I'm going to get jealous with that bastard.

00:50:36.190 --> 00:50:38.260
I'll hit him with a whip that I'll break his head.

00:50:38.550 --> 00:50:39.370
You'll do very badly.

00:50:39.550 --> 00:50:40.710
I'll do very well.

00:50:41.620 --> 00:50:44.500
I've been watching him and he's playing a game that I don't like.

00:50:44.910 --> 00:50:45.910
Don't you think he's dreaming?

00:50:46.110 --> 00:50:48.150
All this ends up having me right to send you.

00:50:48.840 --> 00:50:51.480
That's how you think when you want me to marry you.

00:50:51.910 --> 00:50:52.570
Son of my gun.

00:50:53.000 --> 00:50:53.880
So suddenly?

00:50:54.200 --> 00:50:55.630
Hurry up, run.

00:50:55.830 --> 00:50:56.650
The one you gave me.

00:50:57.580 --> 00:50:58.320
That was before.

00:50:58.520 --> 00:50:59.970
Now, according to...

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:03.160
According to your advice, I want to get married when I'm fed up with Cecily.

00:51:03.240 --> 00:51:05.300
And that?

00:51:05.580 --> 00:51:08.800
Don't you understand that people admit that a woman supports her boyfriend's defiance?

00:51:09.340 --> 00:51:11.290
And she makes fun of her when she can't stand her husband?

00:51:11.510 --> 00:51:13.150
Do I defy you?

00:51:13.290 --> 00:51:15.990
I told you because I didn't take you out of the post office.

00:51:16.050 --> 00:51:18.620
I promise I'll take you on the Sunday you come.

00:51:18.740 --> 00:51:19.540
Stop calling me blood.

00:51:19.700 --> 00:51:21.180
I should have fallen on your face with shame.

00:51:21.560 --> 00:51:23.080
Look, you have me so fed up, so fed up,

00:51:23.080 --> 00:51:25.440
that no one will be able to stand your defiance for a long time.

00:51:25.620 --> 00:51:25.740
Really?

00:51:26.410 --> 00:51:27.530
Yes, really.

00:51:27.890 --> 00:51:29.370
Well, don't get mortified any longer.

00:51:30.220 --> 00:51:32.810
When things don't work out, you know what to do.

00:51:34.170 --> 00:51:37.050
Maria, what has to be done as soon as possible is better.

00:51:39.880 --> 00:51:41.460
But, child, this is for the sake of the brotherhood.

00:51:42.460 --> 00:51:47.770
Olea, come here. You don't know that we are tied up and sentenced to life in prison.

00:51:48.190 --> 00:51:49.150
Quit it, get away from me.

00:51:49.350 --> 00:51:52.880
I just know that your needs hurt me in the soul and that I can't stand them anymore.

00:51:56.240 --> 00:51:58.070
Olea, I don't know.

00:51:58.700 --> 00:51:59.860
Let me go, you bastard.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:00.220
Damn it!

00:52:00.400 --> 00:52:02.180
Damn it!

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:58.910
And that for me you pass as much, as I passed for you, that if your mayor tells you another, you will go back.

00:53:03.420 --> 00:53:11.150
Do you remember me? Don't you see that I can't erase the past from me apart from you?

00:53:11.210 --> 00:53:25.570
I don't betray you, but you do

00:53:30.284 --> 00:53:30.844
Thank you.

00:54:01.880 --> 00:54:02.380
for you

00:54:02.380 --> 00:54:07.430
that for me you passed so

00:54:07.990 --> 00:54:11.750
as I passed for you

00:54:11.750 --> 00:54:15.080
that if your mother

00:54:15.520 --> 00:54:19.190
says something else

00:54:31.470 --> 00:54:33.530
I won't tell you or do anything to you again.

00:54:33.590 --> 00:54:36.680
I give you my word. Don't go.

00:54:36.860 --> 00:54:40.460
I ask you for what you want the most.

00:54:40.540 --> 00:54:42.320
I don't want to see you again, do you hear me?

00:54:42.360 --> 00:54:44.780
I can't stand you anymore. I'm going with whoever else wants me.

00:54:45.080 --> 00:54:47.320
You don't go with anyone because now I'm going to kill you.

00:54:47.580 --> 00:54:54.370
You're going to kill me. This woman is my blessing.

00:54:58.270 --> 00:54:59.580
You're going to kill me.

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:00.720
Are you sending something?

00:55:01.820 --> 00:55:03.400
Don't die of fear and to life.

00:55:03.700 --> 00:55:05.440
Are you going to return?

00:55:06.910 --> 00:55:07.310
Sardines!

00:55:07.370 --> 00:55:13.240
For my health, it has gotten into my heart.

00:55:13.440 --> 00:55:14.960
You already know what you are going to get.

00:55:15.180 --> 00:55:16.570
I drink too much.

00:55:16.790 --> 00:55:18.120
Damn it!

00:55:19.460 --> 00:55:22.020
All that is fixed with two good temporals.

00:55:22.320 --> 00:55:24.620
There is no memory that can withstand the waves of the sea.

00:55:25.040 --> 00:55:26.580
A long trip would not be bad.

00:55:26.580 --> 00:55:29.340
It always comes back before you get depressed.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:01.940
This is a piece of furniture for a stranger with his key and everything.

00:56:02.140 --> 00:56:03.520
You can go out and enter at your will.

00:56:03.680 --> 00:56:05.400
Thank you. I have enough of that.

00:56:05.520 --> 00:56:07.730
What is this? Are you going to give me the letters?

00:56:08.670 --> 00:56:09.330
This is for me.

00:56:09.970 --> 00:56:10.970
Let's see if you don't wait for me.

00:56:11.250 --> 00:56:12.490
Sit down and you'll see what's coming.

00:56:12.670 --> 00:56:16.580
Now cut to the left.

00:56:16.900 --> 00:56:23.660
While I'm placing them, hit the table three times and call them.

00:56:24.500 --> 00:56:24.880
That's right.

00:56:25.100 --> 00:56:27.400
The man you've been looking for your whole life.

00:56:32.460 --> 00:56:34.660
Are you going to call?

00:56:34.880 --> 00:56:35.280
No.

00:56:36.720 --> 00:56:37.760
I'm not going to call.

00:56:43.940 --> 00:56:45.100
They're calling the police.

00:56:45.380 --> 00:56:46.360
I didn't like it.

00:56:46.620 --> 00:56:52.910
I'm sorry I came to bother you.

00:56:53.500 --> 00:56:56.290
I'm going to Medina tomorrow because I can't take it anymore.

00:56:56.510 --> 00:56:57.370
I'm disillusioned.

00:56:57.370 --> 00:56:59.230
I didn't want to do it without saying goodbye to you.

00:57:00.060 --> 00:57:00.360
What's the matter with you?

00:57:00.480 --> 00:57:01.420
I'm very sad.

00:57:01.540 --> 00:57:01.880
What?

00:57:05.560 --> 00:57:06.840
Loneliness, long live my luck!

00:57:07.400 --> 00:57:08.740
What are you saying? You're going back to Medina?

00:57:08.900 --> 00:57:09.420
I'm very sad.

00:57:10.220 --> 00:57:12.270
And you don't even want to give me your hand.

00:57:12.840 --> 00:57:13.860
I'll give you my hand.

00:57:14.040 --> 00:57:14.760
What about your heart?

00:57:14.900 --> 00:57:15.300
Your heart?

00:57:16.510 --> 00:57:18.070
Yours is a bad herb.

00:57:18.310 --> 00:57:18.850
Leave it alone!

00:57:19.350 --> 00:57:21.470
I'm going to go to the house to see if I see a worm.

00:57:21.790 --> 00:57:22.970
What a bad herb, huh?

00:57:23.700 --> 00:57:25.620
Well, be careful, it's going to explore your body.

00:57:25.970 --> 00:57:26.750
What else would I want?

00:57:27.050 --> 00:57:29.740
My hands would become little hands of Jasmín.

00:57:30.860 --> 00:57:31.720
But no, there is no care.

00:57:31.960 --> 00:57:35.600
The Andes have no thorns and you like to torture me.

00:57:36.100 --> 00:57:38.240
Who knows if one day you will reach the roots.

00:57:38.710 --> 00:57:41.410
Don't be in the ashes of my heart that still burns me.

00:57:41.920 --> 00:57:43.300
Time will take care of it.

00:57:43.980 --> 00:57:48.300
Or the opposite, maybe your great absence.

00:57:48.820 --> 00:57:50.960
It depends on you, don't go away from me.

00:57:51.580 --> 00:57:52.960
I do everything you tell me.

00:57:53.180 --> 00:57:55.660
I will wait until God wants.

00:57:56.210 --> 00:57:58.240
Manolo, impose your will.

00:57:58.760 --> 00:57:59.700
It is useless, Soledad.

00:58:00.920 --> 00:58:02.480
A Russian who brings it and carries it in the air.

00:58:03.270 --> 00:58:05.950
I have no choice but to wait for the wind to come in my favor.

01:02:25.790 --> 01:02:27.740
We broke up. What do you want me to do with her?

01:02:27.880 --> 01:02:28.980
Make up with her, as an obligation.

01:02:29.320 --> 01:02:29.880
Talk to her.

01:02:30.090 --> 01:02:32.690
I've had you under my roof for 24 hours.

01:02:33.050 --> 01:02:35.450
You left me with 24 stab wounds in my heart.

01:02:35.810 --> 01:02:37.030
Well, it's an armory.

01:02:37.170 --> 01:02:38.210
Don't make fun of me, I'm serious.

01:02:38.590 --> 01:02:41.680
You should tell all that to Maria Manuela and not me.

01:02:41.880 --> 01:02:43.300
Don't talk to me about Maria Manuela anymore.

01:02:43.620 --> 01:02:45.100
She's very calm with her sister.

01:02:45.360 --> 01:02:46.940
And you, don't you have family?

01:02:47.240 --> 01:02:47.940
The one you give me.

01:02:49.140 --> 01:02:49.700
Well, you're going to stay here.

01:02:49.900 --> 01:02:51.140
And don't get tired, kid.

01:02:51.320 --> 01:02:53.720
If you were the key to my life, I'd lock the door.

01:02:54.040 --> 01:02:54.900
Oh, the key.

01:02:55.550 --> 01:02:57.070
Where will your key be?

01:02:57.500 --> 01:02:59.460
Soleá, we're here to ask you a favor.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:01.220
It's in my hand, with soul and life.

01:03:01.500 --> 01:03:03.080
You say it, Pepa.

01:03:03.760 --> 01:03:04.500
You better say it.

01:03:04.800 --> 01:03:06.230
You say it, Mue.

01:03:06.430 --> 01:03:08.240
If you keep going like this, the night will fall.

01:03:08.490 --> 01:03:12.630
This party will not be complete if you don't sing the songs of the singers.

01:03:12.930 --> 01:03:14.470
We were missing more. Right now.

01:03:14.830 --> 01:03:15.890
Hello, women of Bolivia.

01:03:16.170 --> 01:03:21.000
Now the good starts.

01:05:30.250 --> 01:05:30.650
It's none of your business!

01:06:01.210 --> 01:06:04.560
Really? How was I going to imagine meeting you?

01:06:05.480 --> 01:06:06.400
Not even me with you.

01:06:06.640 --> 01:06:10.000
How could you not be so good? I said, I'm going to see if I can find Pepe Chiclana.

01:06:10.400 --> 01:06:11.160
That's what I said.

01:06:11.380 --> 01:06:15.310
But you don't live on the ship now?

01:06:15.390 --> 01:06:17.430
No one forbids me to go out in search of my friends.

01:06:17.590 --> 01:06:19.080
Do you want your cigar?

01:06:19.220 --> 01:06:20.180
Well, no.

01:06:20.280 --> 01:06:21.320
Your pipe?

01:06:21.500 --> 01:06:22.280
No, thank you.

01:06:22.900 --> 01:06:23.200
Do you wear a tie?

01:06:23.380 --> 01:06:24.620
Yes, but how do I do it?

01:06:24.740 --> 01:06:26.540
Give me the key.

01:06:27.640 --> 01:06:29.340
The one from Soledad's house.

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:31.300
Yes, yes, I'm interested in that woman.

01:06:32.320 --> 01:06:33.540
The cardinal told me to give it to you today.

01:06:33.800 --> 01:06:34.900
Is that true?

01:06:36.040 --> 01:06:38.550
Man, you're going to believe that I'm capable of stealing it.

01:06:38.750 --> 01:06:40.100
It doesn't matter. Come on, let's go.

01:06:40.200 --> 01:06:43.880
What can I do?

01:06:44.710 --> 01:06:46.070
All right, tell me if you don't want to steal it.

01:06:46.190 --> 01:06:47.150
Check it out, check it out.

01:07:31.500 --> 01:07:31.760
Who is it?

01:07:31.860 --> 01:07:33.830
It's Antonio.

01:07:34.130 --> 01:07:35.960
Oh, but are you the one who found the key?

01:07:36.370 --> 01:07:38.170
Wait, man, wait. I'm going to light a match.

01:07:38.490 --> 01:07:38.690
No.

01:07:38.770 --> 01:07:40.150
Why not?

01:07:40.210 --> 01:07:40.390
You!

01:07:46.580 --> 01:07:49.190
It's me, Solea. Forgive me for calling this late.

01:07:50.090 --> 01:07:53.890
But how dare you, you bastard!

01:07:54.720 --> 01:07:56.440
Get out of here! What are you doing here?

01:07:56.500 --> 01:07:59.400
Because I love you too much to consent that no bad shadow...

01:07:59.400 --> 01:07:59.840
Get out of here!

01:08:00.600 --> 01:08:02.520
Listen, woman!

01:08:02.760 --> 01:08:03.940
Get out of here, I tell you!

01:08:04.000 --> 01:08:06.610
How much did Antonio pay you to steal my keys?

01:08:06.730 --> 01:08:09.150
How much did you pay him to come after me to see if I could get out?

01:08:09.310 --> 01:08:10.890
Didn't you give him the keys?

01:08:11.660 --> 01:08:14.840
What? You're going to apologize to me?

01:08:16.020 --> 01:08:16.340
Asshole!

01:08:16.480 --> 01:08:19.220
For the rest of your life, don't you repeat that word that you lose yourself and I lose myself.

01:08:19.440 --> 01:08:21.400
What other name deserves someone who does what you do?

01:08:22.070 --> 01:08:22.930
Asshole, you bastard!

01:08:31.530 --> 01:08:34.700
I wanted more than animals, but it's all over.

01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:38.910
You just turned off this fire that no longer remains in my stomach.

01:08:42.080 --> 01:08:44.240
How did you kill yourself in the afternoon of the Colombians?

01:08:44.340 --> 01:08:46.740
Remember, remember everything you've done to me.

01:08:46.740 --> 01:08:48.760
Tell them I know you. Go, go.

01:08:48.860 --> 01:08:54.220
I'm leaving. And don't forget how much I loved you.

01:08:55.870 --> 01:08:56.810
God save you.

01:09:04.600 --> 01:09:04.960
Thank you.

01:10:18.330 --> 01:10:20.460
to the bottom of the sea

01:10:32.556 --> 01:10:35.276
Our Father, who art in heaven,

01:10:35.596 --> 01:10:37.596
Thank you very much.

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:00.160
Thank you.
